From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bron Gondwana <brong@fastmailteam.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:34:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Add a per-list dkim2_message_instance flag

Let a list opt out of Message-Instance processing even when the site
has it enabled.  The flag is a Boolean column on the mailing list with
an Alembic migration that defaults existing lists to True, is set to
True by the base list style, and is exposed through the REST list
configuration resource.

Both handlers already consult the attribute through _mi_enabled(),
treating an unset value as enabled so lists that predate the migration
keep working.  DKIM2-MESSAGE-INSTANCE.md gains the per-list option.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
